A week or three ago, I posted a related request for a UP2000.
I got a response with an URL to download the sources for the
hwmon package.  The package consists of some I2C kernel driver
modules and a user-space program to read the temperature (and
other things on some MBs).  Some of the kernel modules conflict
(same name) with modules needed for my TV card, so I'm waiting
for the kind soul (forgot his name and am not able to look it
up at the moment) who said he would merge the source trees to
resolve the conflicts.  I asked whether the user-space program
would likely work with the existing RH kernel modules and was
told it would not be likely to work.  The whole thread should
be available in the list archives.

Good luck.

